selected.fragment:
\begin{lemma}
\label{lemma-dimension-local-ring-fibre}
Let $d \in \{0, 1, 2, \ldots, \infty\}$.
The property of morphisms of germs
$$
\mathcal{P}_d((X, x) \to (S, s)) =
\text{the local ring }
\mathcal{O}_{X_s, x}
\text{ of the fibre has dimension }d
$$
is \'etale local on the source-and-target.
\end{lemma}

